{"item_uid": "指考101-math_jia-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "math_jia", "subject_zh": "數學甲", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（單選題、多選題及選填題共占76分）", "stem": "已知一個 n次實係數多項式 f(x)滿足下列性質：\n當 x0時， f(x)0且 f(x)0；\n當 0x1時， f(x)0且 f(x)0；\n當1x4時， f(x)0且 f(x)0；\n當 x4時， f(x)0且 f(x)0。\n請選出正確的選項。\n(1) f(2) f(3)\n(2) f(x)在 x4時有最小值\n(3) f(x)的圖形只有一個反曲點\n(4) n可能為 3\n(5) f(x)的最高次項係數必為正\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 101年指考\n共 7 頁 數 學 甲", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 36.0, "2": 81.0, "3": 23.0, "4": 31.0, "5": 80.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 19.0, "2": 96.0, "3": 6.0, "4": 7.0, "5": 96.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 50.0, "2": 63.0, "3": 45.0, "4": 58.0, "5": 59.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 55.0, "p_high": 85.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 61.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 74.0, 57.0, 36.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
